      "text": "in thee be darkness, how great is that darkness, Matt. 6:23. tell you in darkness, that speak ye in light, Matt. 10:27. cast him into outer darkness, Matt. 22:13. cast ye the unprofitable servant into outer darkness, Matt. 25:30. give light to them that sit in darkness, Luke 1:79 (D&C 57:10). thy body also is full of darkness, Luke 11:34. spoken in darkness shall be heard in the light, Luke 12:3. your hour, and the power of darkness, Luke 22:53. light shineth in darkness; and the darkness comprehended it not, John 1:5. men loved darkness rather than light, John 3:19. night cometh, when no man can work, John 9:4. turn them from darkness to light, Acts 26:18. foolish heart was darkened, Rom. 1:21. cast off the works of darkness, Rom. 13:12. bring to light the hidden things of darkness, 1 Cor. 4:5. commanded the light to shine out of darkness, 2 Cor. 4:6. what communion hath light with darkness, 2 Cor. 6:14. have no fellowship with the unfruitful works of darkness, Eph. 5:11. against the rulers of the darkness, Eph. 6:12. delivered us from the power of darkness, Col. 1:13. out of darkness into his marvellous light, 1 Pet. 2:9. delivered them into chains of darkness, 2 Pet. 2:4. God is light, and in him is no darkness at all, 1 Jn. 1:5. darkness is past, and the true light now shineth, 1 Jn. 2:8.",
